## Proxies

# Forward Proxy:
Sits before sending request to public internet from private
Like tele caller for restaurent orders
Internal Proxy of the company, where all employees requests are being monitored and blocked if it is not relavant
- Checks the safety of the request
- Accessibility of the resource (cdlx blocks social networking sites)
- caching
- Monitoring


# reverse proxy
Sites infrom of public to web server
Like a receptionist infrom of Restaurent to redirect to available table

- Load balances
- caching
- Accessibility
- SSL connection

