## Whats Is Load Balancer, API Gateway, Reverse Proxy
Load Balance: Balances the traffic with out much intelligence and verification process (Apply predefined strategies, like availability, weighted routing, IP hashing way, round robin)
Example: Like parking lot in airport (based on availibility of parkings in each level)

API Gateway: Redirecting based on request 
Like: Airlines specific routing
